\n5. LightLLM token-level scheduling, asynchronous encoding\n6. Mooncake KV-cache centric disaggregated architecture\n7. S-LoRA LoRA adapter scheduling\n8. Hardware adaptation: CUDA stream, NPU task queue, TPU device API, SM affinity, HBM bandwidth-aware scheduling\n\nLet me search for these across the 4 directories. I'll launch multiple parallel searches.","signature":"14f40368-4ddf-47e2-8c6f-2933a4cdeaa3"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":25905,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e709acc-e8b4-42c1-937a-ac6307c17c1d","uuid":"cd566812-0366-4449-8e0d-1fdd6486a66c"}
