？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nLoRA-based MoE 是一类将 LoRA（低秩适配）与 MoE（混合专家）架构结合的 PEFT 方法：在预训练 dense 模型的 transformer 子层中插入多个 LoRA adapter 作为 expert，用可训练 router 为每 token 选择激活的 expert 子集，以低成本扩展容量并获得 MoE 的多任务泛化优势。MixLoRA 的关键设计区别于其他 LoRA-MoE 方法：expert…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation).md","basename":"LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation)","score":843.2841617028106,"foundWords":["sub-rank","sub","seq","lora","lora。lora","lora矩阵:","lora矩阵","loraconfig","multi","multi-tenant:","multi-tenant","multi-task","tenant"],"matches":[{"match":"LoRA","offset":3},{"match":"LoRA","offset":75},{"match":"附加 LoRA。L","offset":447},{"match":"语：\nL","offset":497},{"match":"×","offset":556},{"match":"})\nLoRA","offset":613},{"match":"+ L","offset":673},{"match":"并模式（multi-te","offset":893},{"match":"7 个","offset":927},{"match":"通过 LoraCo","offset":1019},{"match":"：Ada","offset":1136},{"match":"解）、Q","offset":1181},{"match":"、MOE","offset":1199},{"match":"oRA（sub-","offset":1204},{"match":"）、Mi","offset":1228},{"match":"。\n- Multi-ten","offset":1279},{"match":"有独立","offset":1303},{"match":"e。Mi","offset":1337},{"match":"预训练","offset":1395},{"match":"对不同","offset":1428},{"match":"保持各","offset":1472},{"match":"Mix","offset":1498},{"match":"ith","offset":1553},{"match":"- Mi","offset":1587},{"match":"of","offset":1685},{"match":"ive Multi-","offset":1716}],"excerpt":"## LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nLoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation) 由 Hu et al. (2021) 提出，是一种参数高效微调（PEFT）方法。核心思想：对于预训练权重矩阵 W ∈ R^{d1×d2}，不直接微调 W，而是在旁路添加一对低秩分解矩阵 W^A ∈ R^{d1×r} 和 W^B ∈ R^{r×d2}（r << min(d1,d2)），前向计算变为 x' = xW + x·W^A·W^B + b。训练时冻结 W，仅更新 W^A（Kaiming 初始化）…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Prompt-Aware Routing (in MoE-style PEFT).md","basename":"Prompt-Aware Routing (in MoE-style PEFT)","score":397.0404193323725,"foundWords":["sa","softmax","style","states","self-attention","self","serving（每","serving","lora","loramoe","lora修正","lora（如","multi","multi-tenant","tenant"],"matches":[{"match":"style","offset":32},{"match":"LoRA","offset":114},{"match":"LoRA","offset":123},{"match":"style","offset":148},{"match":"LoRA（如","offset":154},{"match":"LoRA","offset":164},{"match":"LoRAMoE","offset":169},{"match":"states","offset":343},{"match":"Self-Attention","offset":368},{"match":"Softmax","offset":430},{"match":"LoRA","offset":455},{"match":"states","offset":653},{"match":"sa","offset":674},{"match":"sa","offset":699},{"match":"Softmax","offset":718},{"match":"Softmax","offset":894},{"match":"LoRA修正","offset":1078},{"match":"LoRA","offset":1204},{"match":"self","offset":1346},{"match":"self-attention","offset":1401},{"match":"景: multi-ten","offset":1521},{"match":"LM servin","offset":1538},{"match":"（每 ten","offset":1548},{"match":"独立 L","offset":1558},{"match":"MiL","offset":1610}],"excerpt":"## Prompt-Aware Routing (in MoE-style PEFT)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nPrompt-Aware Routing 是 MiLoRA 提出的 LoRA expert 路由机制。与传统 MoE-style LoRA（如 MOELoRA、LoRAMoE）的 token-wise routing 不同，prompt-aware routing 在输入 prompt 首次通过 LLM backbone 时仅计算一次路由决策（在生成第一个新 token 之前），后续所有 auto-regressive token 生成步骤均复用该决策。Router 输入为 pro…"}],"totalCount":5,"truncated":false},"effectiveQuery":"S-LoRA LoRA adapter unified paging dynamic scheduling multi-tenant path:knowledge_notes"}}}
