，各自拥有独立调度和弹性伸缩能力。在物理层面，不同阶段可共享相同的 Ascend NPU 硬件资源（共置），通过 operator-level 的空间复用（如 MatMul 用 AI Core…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Colocation vs Disaggregation in A2A Model Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"Colocation vs Disaggregation in A2A Model Serving\",\"score\":5569.431069241724,\"foundWords\":[\"epd-serve\",\"ascend\",\"npu\",\"multimodal\",\"encode\",\"encode-prefill-decode\",\"encoder+thinker\",\"encoder\",\"prefill\",\"decode\",\"disaggregation\",\"epd\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":17},{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":112},{\"match\":\"encoder\",\"offset\":193},{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":237},{\"match\":\"disaggregation\",\"offset\":362},{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":601},{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":662},{\"match\":\"encoder\",\"offset\":814},{\"match\":\"encoder+thinker\",\"offset\":854},{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":977},{\"match\":\"prefill\",\"offset\":1042},{\"match\":\"encoder\",\"offset\":1053},{\"match\":\"npu\",\"offset\":1091},{\"match\":\"encoder\",\"offset\":1131},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1215},{\"match\":\"Encode-Prefill-Decode\",\"offset\":1242},{\"match\":\"Ascend\",\"offset\":1287},{\"match\":\"NPU\",\"offset\":1294},{\"match\":\"Encode\",\"offset\":1560},{\"match\":\"Decode\",\"offset\":1583},{\"match\":\"serve\",\"offset\":1635},{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1672},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1692},{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1713},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":1724},{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":1728},{\"match\":\"Ascend\",\"offset\":1771}],\"excerpt\":\"## Colocation vs Disaggregation in A2A Model Serving\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nColocation 和 Disaggregation 是 A2A 模型推理 Serving 中图级别的两种基本部署策略。Colocation 将多个 model component（如 encoder + LLM）合并到同一个 executor 中运行，共享 GPU 资源；Disaggregation 将不同 component 解耦到独立 executor（通常在不同 GPU 上），允许各自独立扩展。在 Cornfigurato…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/TTFT _ TPOT SLO Constraints in Multimodal Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"TTFT _ TPOT SLO Constraints in Multimodal Serving\",\"score\":4612.11383491207,\"foundWords\":[\"epd-serve\",\"ascend\",\"npu\",\"npu；\",\"multimodal\",\"encode\",\"encode→prefill\",\"encode/prefill\",\"encode-disaggregated\",\"prefill\",\"prefill→decode\",\"decode\",\"decode-disaggregated\",\"disaggregation\",\"epd\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":34},{\"match\":\"Encode\",\"offset\":247},{\"match\":\"Prefill\",\"offset\":256},{\"match\":\"Decode\",\"offset\":294},{\"match\":\"Decode\",\"offset\":352},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":368},{\"match\":\"Encode-disaggregated\",\"offset\":394},{\"match\":\"Decode-disaggregated\",\"offset\":429},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":564},{\"match\":\"NPU\",\"offset\":643},{\"match\":\"Decode\",\"offset\":1108},{\"match\":\"NPU；\",\"offset\":1208},{\"match\":\"Encode→Prefill\",\"offset\":1340},{\"match\":\"Prefill→Decode\",\"offset\":1377},{\"match\":\"Decode\",\"offset\":1439},{\"match\":\"Encode/Prefill\",\"offset\":1456},{\"match\":\"NPU\",\"offset\":1474},{\"match\":\"Decode\",\"offset\":1509},{\"match\":\"NPU\",\"offset\":1516},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1570},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1665},{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1686},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":1697},{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":1701},{\"match\":\"Ascend\",\"offset\":1744}],\"excerpt\":\"## TTFT / TPOT SLO Constraints in Multimodal Serving\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTTFT (Time-To-First-Token) 和 TPOT (Time-Per-Output-Token) 是多模态推理 Serving 系统的两个核心延迟 SLO（Service Level Objective）指标。TTFT 衡量从请求到达系统到生成第一个 token 的时间（包含 Encode + Prefill 延迟），TPOT 衡量后续每个 token 的平均生成时间（Decode 阶段的延迟）。在多模态场景下，TTFT 受视觉编码器和跨阶段数据传…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mooncake Store.md\",\"basename\":\"Mooncake Store\",\"score\":1686.2623376609972,\"foundWords\":[\"epd-serve\",\"。epd-serve\",\"ascend\",\"npu\",\"multimodal\",\"encode\",\"prefill\",\"decode\",\"disaggregation\",\"epd\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":127},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":484},{\"match\":\"Encode\",\"offset\":544},{\"match\":\"Prefill\",\"offset\":600},{\"match\":\"Prefill\",\"offset\":766},{\"match\":\"Decode\",\"offset\":822},{\"match\":\"Ascend\",\"offset\":1237},{\"match\":\"。EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1319},{\"match\":\"Ascend\",\"offset\":1350},{\"match\":\"NPU\",\"offset\":1357},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1409},{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1430},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":1441},{\"match\":\"Disaggregation\",\"offset\":1445},{\"match\":\"Ascend\",\"offset\":1488}],\"excerpt\":\"Mooncake Store 是 Moonshot AI 的 Mooncake 项目中的分布式 KVCache 存储引擎，被 EPD-Serve 用作底层跨阶段异步 tensor 传输中间件。它是面向 PD 分离架构的分层缓存系统，支持跨 DRAM、VRAM、NVMe 的批量数据传输，原生支持 TCP、RDMA（InfiniBand/RoCEv2/GPUDirect）、CXL/共享内存、NVMe over Fabric 等协议。Mooncake 的核心设计理念是\\\"用更多存储换取更少计算\\\"（Trading More Storage for Less Computation），获 FAST 2025 最佳论文奖。开源地址：https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake。\\n从系统架构角度拆解…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Stage Disaggregation for Multimodal Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"Stage Disaggregation for Multimodal Serving\",\"score\":60.00242327365721,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"serve\",\"server（dedicated\",\"server，但配置独立。\",\"server\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Serve\",\"offset\":394},{\"match\":\"Serve\",\"offset\":577},{\"match\":\"server\",\"offset\":1561},{\"match\":\"server，但配置独立。\",\"offset\":1622},{\"match\":\"Serve\",\"offset\":1656},{\"match\":\"server（dedicated\",\"offset\":1772},{\"match\":\"Serve\",\"offset\":1880},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":1913},{\"match\":\"Serve\",\"offset\":2013},{\"match\":\"Serve\",\"offset\":2729}],\"excerpt\":\"…e）不同，multimodal stage disaggregation 的核心是在 image-specific stages 和 text-specific stages 之间划分解耦边界。ModServe 论文将 pipeline 拆分为 Image Instances（CPU image preprocessing + GPU image encoding）和 Text Instances（LLM prefill + decode），每个池独立管理 TP 度、batch size 和 autoscaling 策略。\\n从系统架构角度拆解术语：\\nModServe 的 stage disaggregation 运转流程：\\n```\\n请求到达 → Modality-Aware Router:\\n  ├─ Text-only request → 直接路由到 Text Pool Manager…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling.md\",\"basename\":\"Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling\",\"score\":54.40759442862177,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"epd-serve\",\"serve\",\"server\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":125},{\"match\":\"Server\",\"offset\":410},{\"match\":\"Server\",\"offset\":1024},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1303},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1422},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":1454}],\"excerpt\":\"Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling 是 EPD-Serve 的请求级调度策略，根据请求是否包含非文本模态（图像/音频/视频）将其路由到不同的执行管道。多模态请求走完整的 Encode-Prefill-Decode 管道，纯文本请求直接走 Prefill-Decode 管道（绕过 Encode 阶段）。配合 instance-level 的 least-loaded-first 动态负载均衡，实现异构流量分离和资源隔离。\\n从系统架构角度拆解术语，比如术语如何在系统架构中发挥作用，给出术语在系统架构中运转流程的具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n多路径调度+负载均衡的运转流程：\\n```\\nAPI Server 接收请求\\n  │…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchically Grouped KV Cache Transmission.md\",\"basename\":\"Hierarchically Grouped KV Cache Transmission\",\"score\":50.44545932639332,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"epd-serve\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":141},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":258},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":623},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1584},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1676},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":1708}],\"excerpt\":\"Hierarchically Grouped KV Cache Transmission 是 EPD-Serve 中用于 P-D 跨阶段 KV Cache 传输的优化机制。针对 naive 的同步全量传输——所有 Transformer 层 KVCache 在 Prefill 完成后一次性传输——导致的通信拥塞和高 TTFT，EPD-Serve 提出三层优化：(1) Layer-wise Transmission：按 Transformer 层分拆传输单元，当 Prefill 计算 L+1 层时传输 L 层 KVCache；(2) Grouped Packaging：将相邻多层 KVCache 打包为一个 group 传输，减少握手频率和 metadata overhead；(3) P…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multimodal Inference Pipeline Stages (Encode _ Prefill _ Decode).md\",\"basename\":\"Multimodal Inference Pipeline Stages (Encode _ Prefill _ Decode)\",\"score\":50.31044882398299,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"epd-serve\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":146},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":690},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":1626},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1853},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":2061},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":2093}],\"excerpt\":\"Multimodal Inference Pipeline 是 EPD-Serve 定义的 MLLM 推理三阶段划分：(1) **Encode 阶段**：多模态编码器 E（Vision Transformer / Audio Encoder 等）将原始多模态输入 I_m 转换为高维特征向量序列 V_m ∈ R^{n×d}，作为 Prefill 阶段的输入特征；(2) **Prefill 阶段**：文本提示 I_t 编码为 V_t，拼接多模态特征 V_m + V_t 输入 LLM Decoder，执行首次前向传播生成首 token O_1 并构建全层 KVCache KV1；(3) **Decode 阶段**：基于 KVCache 和上一 token，LLM…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture (AI Core _ AI Vector _ Da Vinci).md\",\"basename\":\"Ascend NPU Architecture (AI Core _ AI Vector _ Da Vinci)\",\"score\":49.86616342763635,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"epd-serve\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":166},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":665},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":2800},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":2888},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":2920}],\"excerpt\":\"Ascend NPU 是华为自主研发的 AI 加速处理器，基于 Da Vinci（达芬奇）架构。新一代 A2 系列（如 EPD-Serve 使用的 Atlas 800I A2 服务器）采用分离式 AI Core 设计，核心计算单元分为三类：（1）**AI Core（AIC/矩阵核/Cube Unit）**：负责大规模矩阵乘法运算（16×16×16 的 MAC 阵列），是主要算力来源，执行 MatMul 等算子；（2）**AI Vector（AIV/向量核/Vector Unit）**：负责向量运算（激活函数、Element-wise 操作、AllReduce 通信等），256 位 SIMD 向量运算，比 Cube Unit 灵活但算力低；（3）**Scalar Unit**：负责程序流程控制和标量数据运算。三者…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Asynchronous Feature Prefetching (E-P Stage).md\",\"basename\":\"Asynchronous Feature Prefetching (E-P Stage)\",\"score\":49.73172771228542,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"epd-serve\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":129},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":551},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1592},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":1730},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":1762}],\"excerpt\":\"Asynchronous Feature Prefetching 是 EPD-Serve 中用于 E-P 跨阶段数据传输的优化机制。核心思想：不直接传输 Encode 阶段产生的完整特征向量（可能很大，如 4K 分辨率图像产生 [16206, 3584] 的 tensor），而是仅传输特征的 hash 值（轻量事件），让 Prefill 实例通过 MM Store 异步检索和预取特征数据。传输与 Encode 计算重叠，隐藏通信延迟。三个关键子机制：Multimodal Cache Pooling（MM Store 缓存）、Event-Driven Asynchronous Prefetching（事件驱动的 hash 通知）、Fault-Tolerant Re…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Multimodal Cache Pooling _ MM Store.md\",\"basename\":\"Multimodal Cache Pooling _ MM Store\",\"score\":48.19353703057066,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"epd-serve\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":121},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":2110},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":2142}],\"excerpt\":\"MM Store（Multimodal Cache Pooling）是 EPD-Serve 中用于跨 Encode-Prefill 阶段共享已编码多模态特征的分布式缓存池。它以多模态输入的 hash 值为 key、对应的特征向量（feature vector）为 value 存储。核心设计目标：避免重复编码相同多模态输入，支持跨请求的特征复用，并作为 E-P 异步预取机制的数据源实现零拷贝特征传输。\\n从系统架构角度拆解术语，比如术语如何在系统架构中发挥作用，给出术语在系统架构中运转流程的具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMM Store 在 E-P 异步预取中的运转流程：\\n```\\nEncode 实例                    MM Sto…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Multimodal Component Graph (A2A Model Architecture).md\",\"basename\":\"Multimodal Component Graph (A2A Model Architecture)\",\"score\":43.6410234136556,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"epd-serve\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"serve\",\"offset\":1991},{\"match\":\"EPD-Serve\",\"offset\":2048},{\"match\":\"EPD\",\"offset\":2080}],\"excerpt\":\"- Cornserve Efficiently Serving Any-to-Any Multimodal Models\\n- EPD-Serve A Flexible Multimodal EPD Disaggregation Inference Serving System On Ascend\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cornserve.md\",\"basename\":\"Cornserve\",\"score\":43.46437650593907,\"foundWords\":[\"epd\",\"epd）均通过\",\"serve\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"serve\",\"offset\":7},{\"match\":\"serve\",\"offset\":63},{\"match\":\"serve\",\"offset\":233},{\"match\":\"serve\",\"offset\":246},{\"match\":\"serve\",\"offset\":360},{\"match\":